# Build artifacts: Rust's target dir lives outside the repo (see the README),
# and the Node sidecar is a 92 MB copy of the local node.exe that belongs on
# nobody's disk. This checkout sits in its build workspace, so the workspace's
# own target dir is ignored here too.
/target/
/desktop/src-tauri/target/
/desktop/src-tauri/gen/
/desktop/sidecar/*.exe
/desktop/sidecar/*.dll

# Local state — sessions, staged uploads and logs are machine-local by design.
/.aipass/
.mimosa/

node_modules/
*.log
